@Kwame Adjei-Rowe: Moss's Coastal digest from Sunday 2 Nov 2025 is the only source I found. It says Pellucid Harbor Logistics "changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03." So the date for the CRM is **3 November 2025**.

The digest doesn't say who the account moved to. I couldn't find the account files, so I can't confirm from the records that it moved to you. The Coastal cheat sheet lists it as a Coastal account but gives no date. If you need the handover itself confirmed, check with Bettina or Ruth.

Also, "PHL" is sometimes used for both Pellucid Harbor Logistics and Covey & Lark Retail, so check you're logging it against the right org.
